ections of the town hunk beau larson  and he is such a cutie am i right  we've all heard dove's beautiful singing  voice before but here she gets to show  off her dance moves and put on an  adorable southern accent even though her  role in the film is small  dove still shines and makes a big  impression your moment is so good at  just everything else who doesn't love a  musical  better yet who doesn't love a live tv  musical it's all the magic of broadway  but from the comfort of your own home  and 2016 hairspray live was no exception  but it was made even better because our  fave descendant star got to shine in it  something you might not have known about  dove cameron is that she's actually a  prolific  stage performer as well having starred  in productions of les miserables  mamma mia and clueless the musical so  she was a natural fit for hairspray  [Applause]  duff played the role of amber von  tussell the ambitious mean girl  in this star-studded live tv special of  the musical hairspray alongside ariana  grande kristen chenoweth and jennifer  hudson  we hate to say it but we think dove even  outsang ariana  keep the stupid crown amber i have my  heart set on something a lot more  important  this next one is definitely overlooked  way back in 2012 in only her second  television role dove guest starred on  the mentalist  in the episode devil's cherry the  mentalist follows patrick jane played by  simon baker  a so-called mentalist who uses his  observational skills to help solve  crimes  in a bizarre series of events jane  encounters a mysterious girl claiming to  be his deceased daughter charlotte  played by none other than dove cameron  i had a daughter named charlotte  i know this was one of dove's earliest  roles on tv but she was lucky enough to  get to work closely with the main star  playing charlotte jane a character who  only appears to jane in hallucinations  throughout the episode  made for a really interesting  performance and dynamic between the  characters even as her career was just  burgeoning dove chose some fantastic  roles that no doubt helped put her on  the map  i mean we're dead gone  you need to start dealing with that  interestingly dev also starred in  another show involving criminal cases  only this time it's a comedy that spoofs  police procedurals just like the  mentalist angie tribeca  is known for its long list of amazing  guest stars lisa kudrow  is just so funny one of whom was dove  cameron  in a bit of a departure from her usual  projects dove appeared in season four of  this quirky comedy created by nancy and  steve carell of the office fame  the show stars rashida jones as angie  tribeca a veteran police detective who  goes undercover at a high school glee  club in the episode glitch perfect  duff cameron guest start is grace one of  the students and glee club members not  only can dove kill it in dramatic roles  but she's also got some seriously funny  comedic chops  if you thought dub couldn't be any more  talented just wait till we tell you  about her voiceover work dove lent her  voice to play the iconic spider-man  character gwen stacy  aka spider-gwen aka ghost spider she  started voicing gwen stacy on the  animated tv show  ultimate spider-man and i'm trying to be  a hero like you two  she's since returned to the role of gwen  stacy as ghost spider in a number of  marvel rising shorts over the past few  years  fun fact dev also sang the theme song  for the first marvel rising  secret warriors and while this is only  speculation dove may even be in line to  play spider gwen in the live-action mcu  in an interview with yahoo entertainment  dove said she'd love to play gwen stacy  having already voiced the character we  think she'd be perfect opposite  tom holland spider-man what do you think  i would love it if she was like an equal  match  but spider-man isn't the only thing dove  has lent her voice to did you know she  also did the voice of ella in the angry  birds movie too  a sequel to the angry birds movie based  on the infamous game  angry birds 2 sees the birds having to  join forces with the pigs when the bird  and piggy islands are both threatened by  a common enemy  the eagles ella is described as a  workaholic type  a bird but she's also super independent  and opinionated  yeah you know what maybe it's your  eyebrows my eyebrows are fine  apparently ella was originally supposed  to look very different but after dove  cameron was cast in the role the  producers decided it would be funny to  change her into a dove we're glad  because her character design is  fittingly adorable  um are you mad last but not least dove  also appears as a recurring character on  the lodge which premiered on the disney  channel uk  in 2016 while duff broke out as the  disney starlet on liv and maddie and the  descendants  film series this disney uk series is a  lesser known gem that you might not have  known about the lodge follows  fifteen-year-old skye who moves to  northern ireland with her father to take  over a hotel called the north star  dove played the character jess in four  episodes of the show where she played a  competitive biker  and friend of main character sean played  by none other than thomas daughtry  that's right  dove's descendants co-star and irl  boyfriend and we have to say  their chemistry is undeniable on screen  as well as off  yeah sean actually cut me up here once  pretty bad  at just 24 years old dove cameron has  already had a prolific career  she even has two films slated for 2021  called  isaac and vengeance we can't wait to see  more from this exciting young star  did you know about some of dove's  lesser-known roles leave a comment below  and don't forget to subscribe for more  awesome content from the things  thanks for watching  you
 

